    "summary": "The user, acting as a sociology curriculum developer, asks the assistant to provide academic frameworks and validate a specific conclusion regarding the inevitability of racial inequality within current economic structures. The assistant provides academic terms and ultimately confirms the user's premise that systemic overhaul is the only theoretical solution to racial inequity.",
